# apps/web — web client

The rules of the root `AGENTS.md` apply. This file holds only local ones.

## Boundaries

- One internal dependency: `@{{ project_name }}/uikit`. Everything else is external packages.
- Screens are built from ready-made `@{{ project_name }}/uikit` components. If a component is missing, add it to UIKit instead of laying it out here on the spot: a one-off component inside a screen is a future style divergence.
- Color: UIKit theme tokens only. No color literals of its own here.
- Interactivity goes on `button`/`a`, not on a `div` with `onClick`; focus is visible.

## Checks

`bun run --filter '@{{ project_name }}/web' typecheck`, `bun run --filter '@{{ project_name }}/web' test`, `bunx biome check apps/web`, `bun run --filter '@{{ project_name }}/web' build`.
